",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-09-05T12:18:19.400Z\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":[\\\"fa\\\",\\\"en\\\"],\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Person\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://mehrdad.ir/#person\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Mehrdad\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://mehrdad.ir/\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Person\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://mehrdad.ir/#person\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Mehrdad\\\"},\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://mehrdad.ir/blog/%d8%b1%d8%a7%d9%87%d9%86%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c-%da%a9%d8%a7%d9%85%d9%84-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b7%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%ad%db%8c-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%be-%d9%85%d8%a7%d8%b1%da%a9\\\"},\\\"image\\\":[\\\"/media/Artificial-Intellige3.jpg\\\"],\\\"keywords\\\":\\\"Startup, Investment, Artificial Intelligence, Marketing\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://mehrdad.ir/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Blog\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://mehrdad.ir/blog\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Complete Guide to Designing an AI Startup Marketing: Key Tools and Solutions\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://mehrdad.ir/blog/%d8%b1%d8%a7%d9%87%d9%86%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c-%da%a9%d8%a7%d9%85%d9%84-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b7%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%ad%db%8c-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%be-%d9%85%d8%a7%d8%b1%da%a9\\\"}]}]}2d:T2d77,\\u003ch1\\u003eAI in Marketing: Modern Approaches and Designing Smart Startups\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eHere, we examine modern AI approaches in the marketing field and analyze innovative ideas for using these technologies to design marketing startups. Using AI in marketing allows us to interact more intelligently with customers and manage the improvement of our marketing systems and processes. This article will provide a detailed look at designing an AI marketing startup and explore key points for creating an efficient and successful strategy in this area.\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eIntroduction\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eDesigning an AI marketing startup is now recognized as one of the critical factors for the growth and advancement of businesses and brands. By leveraging AI technologies, these startups can improve their performance by analyzing data accurately, predicting customer behavior, and offering creative marketing solutions, thereby quickly achieving growth and development. This article will guide you in understanding how to design and launch a successful AI marketing startup using artificial intelligence and benefit from the new opportunities in the modern market.\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\nsrc=\\\"/media/Artificial-Intellige5-1024x585.jpg\\\"AI startup in the marketing field – Mehrdad's website – Designing Isfahan city using artificial intelligence\\n\\u003ch2\\u003eThe necessity of using AI in marketing\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eThe use of AI in marketing can bring about a tremendous transformation in business and marketing activities. This technology enables companies to analyze customer behavioral patterns with greater accuracy, improve marketing based on this analysis, and move toward a more effective customer experience.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eAI can dynamically and more accurately use both structured and unstructured information to gain a complete understanding of customer behavior. This analyzed information can help in drawing up effective and targeted marketing strategies.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eFurthermore, AI can improve the timing and execution of marketing campaigns. For example, using AI algorithms, companies can optimize the timing of sending emails or text messages to customers based on their activities and behavioral patterns. This leads to increased customer engagement and reduced marketing costs.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eIn summary, the use of AI allows companies to market more effectively and use data to create a better customer experience and improve their marketing performance.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eKey Elements\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eIn creating an AI marketing startup, some key and essential elements must be considered, including:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e1. Data analysis: Detailed and advanced data analysis is one of the most important elements of using AI in marketing. This includes extracting useful information from structured and unstructured data, identifying customer patterns and trends, and predicting future customer behaviors based on existing data.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e2. Predicting customer behavior: Using AI to predict customer behavior is of high importance. This includes identifying purchasing patterns, combinations of preferred products, purchasing timing, and customer preferences. This information helps companies create a better experience for customers by offering suggestions and services that match their needs.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e3. Improving marketing decisions: The goal of using AI in marketing is to increase the accuracy and quality of marketing decisions. These decisions include setting prices, designing advertisements, and selecting marketing channels.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eOverall, creating an AI marketing startup requires accurate and comprehensive data analysis, predicting customer behavior based on this analysis, and improving marketing decisions based on these analyses.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\nsrc=\\\"/media/Artificial-Intellige4-1024x585.jpg\\\"AI startup in the marketing field – Mehrdad's website – Designing using artificial intelligence\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eExamples and Applications\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eThere are many real-world examples and applications of using AI in marketing, and this technology has been used to improve customer experience and enhance the marketing performance of companies.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eOne prominent example of AI in marketing is its application in e-commerce. Major companies like Amazon and Netflix use AI algorithms to recommend products and content based on users' past interests and behaviors. These algorithms, as predictive experiences, guide customers to content or products related to their interests and needs, leading to increased sales and customer satisfaction.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eIn online advertising, AI technology is used to optimize advertising campaigns and determine how to target based on customer data. For example, major advertising companies like Google and Facebook use AI to analyze information related to customers and how they interact with ads to display ads more targeted and generate higher returns.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eAs another successful example of using AI in marketing, we can mention the startup \\\"Sensai.\\\" Sensai is an AI platform that helps companies optimize their social content and improve marketing. This platform extracts communication data from social media and similar sources, then analyzes this data to help companies share appropriate content to attract customers and optimize their marketing.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eAlso, a startup called \\\"Twiggle\\\" uses AI in the \\u003ca href=\\\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d9%85%d8%af%db%8c%d8%b1%db%8c%d8%aa-%d8%a7%d9%86%d8%b1%da%98%db%8c-%d8%af%d8%b1-%d8%b4%d9%87%d8%b1-%d9%87%d9%88%d8%b4%d9%85%d9%86%d8%af-%d9%88-%d8%b1%d8%a7%d9%87%da%a9%d8%a7%d8%b1%d9%87%d8%a7%db%8c/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003ee-commerce\\u003c/a\\u003e field. Twiggle uses AI and machine learning technology to improve the customer shopping experience. This company has created powerful search and similarity recognition algorithms to help customers quickly and more accurately find the products they need.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eIn these examples, it is clearly seen that the use of AI has a positive impact on marketing and customer experience. These startups have shown that by using data analysis, predicting customer behavior, and improving marketing decisions, they can achieve greater accuracy and efficiency in marketing and sales.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eThese examples are just a sample of AI applications in marketing. Since AI technology is rapidly developing, new examples of successful applications of this technology in marketing are constantly emerging.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eImportant points and guidance for businesses and startups in AI marketing\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eOf course, in the field of using AI in marketing, several key points can be mentioned that are useful for businesses and startups:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e1. Deep understanding of customers: Through AI, you can comprehensively analyze customer data and better understand their behavioral patterns and needs. This information helps you interact with your customers more precisely and intelligently and optimize your marketing strategy according to their needs.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\u003ch4\\u003e2. New Opportunities: AI can help you identify new opportunities and respond quickly. By analyzing complex data and hidden relationships, you can better understand the market, competitors, and customers and respond more effectively.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e3. Making Smarter Decisions: By using AI, you can easily improve data-driven decisions. These decisions can help you improve your marketing strategies, advertising, and sales processes and respond quickly.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e4. Better Customer Experience: By leveraging AI, you can improve your \\u003ca href=\\\"https://mehrdad.ir/%da%af%d9%81%d8%aa%da%af%d9%88%db%8c%db%8c-%d8%af%d8%b1-%d9%85%d9%88%d8%b1%d8%af-%d9%be%da%98%d9%88%d9%87%d8%b4-%d9%87%d8%a7-%d9%88-%d8%a7%d8%ae%d8%aa%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%b9%d8%a7%d8%aa-%d8%ac%d8%af%db%8c/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003eexperience\\u003c/a\\u003e and provide them with more targeted services and content.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e5. Prediction and Optimization Capabilities: AI enables you to improve marketing trends using predictive models and make better use of your historical data for further optimization.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eIn summary, using AI can help businesses and startups create more effective marketing strategies, improve their marketing, and market more intelligently in response to the growing needs of customers.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e \\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eExamples of AI in Marketing\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eToday, in the marketing field, the use of AI by startups has become very common. These startups use AI technologies to improve marketing, advertising, and customer communication processes. Some of these startups include:\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e1. Persado: This startup uses AI to generate marketing content. Persado automatically optimizes ads and marketing text by identifying patterns of the most effective words and phrases.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e2. Albert Technologies: Albert is an AI platform that automatically optimizes advertising campaigns and makes smarter decisions based on content and performance advancements.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003e3. Conversica: This startup uses AI to create chatbots that communicate with customers and interact with them automatically and intelligently.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eThese startups are examples of AI in marketing that, by using this technology, have improved their marketing processes and achieved a better customer experience.\\u003c/h4\\u003e\\nsrc=\\\"/media/Artificial-Intellige6-1024x585.jpg\\\"AI Marketing Startup – Mehrdad's Website – Design using Artificial Intelligence – Iranian Art\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eInvitation to Collaborate and Invest\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003ch4\\u003eAs we operate as an \\u003ca href=\\\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7